                   distribution). [561]

           •       HTML files will now be installed in c:\perl\html instead of
                   c:\perl\lib\pod\html

           •       REG_EXPAND_SZ keys are now allowed in registry settings
                   used by perl. [561]

           •       Can now sseenndd(()) from all threads, not just the first one.
